wgf-autopilot 1
# A smoke run: the textures loaded, the player moved by a key and by a pad's stick, and sent
# behind the other sprites and back by the fire action, from the keyboard and from the pad.
at 0 wait sprites.loaded == 1
at 10 expect sprites.x == 400
at 10 expect sprites.front == 1
at 20 key down right
at 60 key up right
at 61 expect sprites.x > 500
at 70 pad 0 connect
at 72 pad 0 axis left_y -1
at 102 pad 0 axis left_y 0
at 103 expect sprites.y < 300
at 110 key tap space
at 111 expect sprites.front == 0
at 120 pad 0 tap south
at 121 expect sprites.front == 1
at 150 end
